Segments contain at most24n attempts, with final short segment. A/C have3 segments per chain,B2:128 jobs. All original trajectory state is retained, including partial batch sums, accepted runs, tag extrema, rejection direction, and exact RNG state. Receipt binds predecessor receipt hash and checkpoint hash; output files are immutable. A failed or partial job is preserved; launcher stops rather than retrying. A standalone next-segment invocation requires the immediately preceding complete checkpoint and exact expected step. The launch command intentionally requires a fresh study output directory; unplanned restart or retry is not automatic.

